# Task 4 Report: Schema-v2 Contracts, Manifest, Objective, and Validation Ledger

## Status

Implemented the schema-v2 optimizer role contracts, policy-source scope, call budgets, run manifest, provider-free subset builder, create-only manifest writer, gate/prepare command, Decimal discovery/holdout objective, and permanent hash-chained validation-exposure ledger. No candidate source was imported or executed. No replay, provider, pricing, Docker, network, upload, push, merge, or cloud action was performed.

Committed as `89bdea5 feat: define PIT optimizer v2 contracts`. The Ruff, trailing-whitespace, EOF, YAML, and merge-conflict pre-commit hooks passed on the successful commit. The first commit attempt was safely stopped after Ruff removed one unused import; the focused suite was rerun green before restaging and retrying.

## Files

- Modified `core/pit_optimization_contract.py`
  - Preserved the schema-v1 catalog, readers, response schemas, observations, comparisons, and policy-delta behavior.
  - Added schema-v2 constants, system prompts, closed role artifacts/inputs/summaries, `PatchBounds`, `PitOptimizerCallBudget`, `PolicySourceScope`, `AuthorizationRequirement`, `PitOptimizerRunManifest`, `PitOptimizerGateConfig`, provider-free manifest construction, canonical create-only writing, and prepare-command rendering.
- Modified `core/pit_optimizer_evaluation.py`
  - Preserved Task 2 `FoldSpec`, `FoldManifest`, `AggregateMetric`, and `FoldAggregateSummary` identity rules.
  - Added `DiscoveryScore`, `HoldoutDecision`, fixed-baseline discovery scoring helpers, and the locked hash-chained `ValidationLedger` contracts.
- Created `tests/test_pit_optimizer_v2.py`
  - Contains ten behavior-focused tests using only synthetic sources, an inert synthetic SQLite PIT calendar, and local temporary artifacts.
- Created this ignored evidence report at `.superpowers/sdd/2026-08-27-model-authored-pit-optimizer/task-4-report.md`.

